# Saved transcriber output. It is a caller's own words — their name, and on at least one
# recording their policy number. `recordings/` is gitignored for the same reason; the
# transcript side of the same call does not get an exemption for being text.
runs/
results/

# Claims that carry a real identifier as ground truth. `claims/*.json` is committed so the
# format and the known gaps are shared; anything with a live policy number in it goes here.
claims/local/
